  "bodyHash": "0CbGRDmUioI=",
  "content": "<h1>沉浸式叠加显示</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-overlays%252fversions%253fl%253dfabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-overlays%252fversions%253fl%253dneoforge%2526l%253dforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cassiancc/Cassians-Badges/refs/heads/main/cozy/NeoForge.svg\" alt=\"forge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/raspberry-flavoured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cassiancc/Cassians-Badges/refs/heads/main/cozy/Raspberry-Flavoured.svg\" alt=\"Raspberry Flavoured\"></a></p><p>本模组将高度可配置的坐标叠加显示整合为游戏内机制，使其仅在玩家持有指南针时可见。此外，还提供类似的时钟叠加显示，展示当前时间。</p><h2>坐标叠加显示</h2><p>当玩家物品栏（包括收纳袋）中持有指南针时，将显示玩家X轴和Z轴坐标的叠加信息。</p><p>若玩家额外持有显示深度的物品（如<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>的高度计，或来自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a>等模组的深度计），则会同时显示Y轴坐标值。若无此类物品，仅指南针即可触发叠加显示。</p><h2>时间与天气叠加显示</h2><p>当玩家物品栏（包括收纳袋）中持有时钟时，将显示当前时间的叠加信息。</p><p>若玩家额外持有显示天气的物品（如<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a>的气压计），则会同时显示天气状况。若无此类物品，仅时钟即可触发叠加显示。</p><h2>模组兼容性</h2><p>本模组原生支持<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>的物品。其他模组的物品可通过配置选项添加。</p><h2>风力叠加显示</h2><p>当玩家物品栏（包括收纳袋）中持有风力计时，将显示风力强度与方向的叠加信息。</p><ul>\n<li>安装<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbreezy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Breezy</a>模组时，数据来源于该模组的阵风计。</li>\n</ul><h2>鸣谢</h2><p>本模组的概念源自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fnoelledotjpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nöelle</a>为Raspberry Flavoured制作的雏形。我在自己的模组<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fraspberry-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raspberry Core</a>中对此概念进行迭代开发，最终在本模组\"沉浸式叠加显示\"中定型。</p><p>材质与模组图标同样由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fnoelledotjpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nöelle</a>制作。</p><p>温度叠加显示与季节叠加显示的材质由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProbablyEkho\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProbablyEkho</a>制作。</p><p>无人之地、丰沛大气、新世界生物群系叠加显示的材质由KevBo制作。</p>",
